fxfile
======

Copyright (c) 2013 Leon Lee Author. All rights reserved.


Overview
--------
fxfile is a free, open source, professional file manager for Microsoft Windows platform.


Requirements to Build
----------------------
1. Clone customized gyp of fxfile.
   git clone https://github.com/fxfile/gyp tools/gyp

2. Check out python.
   svn co https://src.chromium.org/svn/trunk/tools/third_party/python_274 tools/python_274


Build on Windows
----------------
1. Run 'build.bat' batch file to generate MSVS solution file.
   build.bat [msvs_version] [target_arch] [platform_toolset]
   e.g.) build.bat 2015 x64
         build.bat 2008 x86

   For a current Visual Studio that does not provide the VS2015 v140
   toolset, keep the GYP generator at 2015 and pass the installed toolset
   as the third argument. For example, Visual Studio 2026 uses v145:
         build.bat 2015 x64 v145

   When building x64, select a matching configuration/platform pair such as
   'Debug-x64-Unicode | x64' or 'Release-x64-Unicode | x64'.

2. Build 'fxfile.sln'.
   Run 'devenv.exe' and build


